    "sub_ename": "APPLICATION  OF  BUILDING  INFORMATION  MODELING  IN  STEEL  STRUCTURE  CONSTRUCTION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以實務建築工程為例，學習使用Tekla Structures 建立RC結構BIM模型應用於RC施工階段，依據模型結果產出工程數量報表與圖面。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces Tekla Structures to implement the 3D RC construction model and generate relevant reports and drawings in construction.",
